\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par   1. \cf0    Now we give thanks to our God,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 For all His acts of goodness
\par He has blessed us with good health
\par He has filled us with good food.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.   If He cares for our body
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 We shall not forget our soul;
\par It was for him that our Lord
\par Came down to earth from Heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He is good food for our soul;
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 He gives us God's 'lasting life;
\par His love we do not reject,
\par \pard     And we too shall have His life.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

